#### Updated executeAsyncBatchCreation (Atomicity Fix)
To stop the "105,000" bug, we must ensure that we strictly manage the lifecycle of the background threads. [cite_start]I have added a **Pre-emptive Purge** and a **Strict Join** to ensure no orphan rows are left behind [cite: 742-764].
