 * [cite_start]**Synchronized State**: The updateState fix ensures that when Stage 1 and Stage 2 of validation overlap, they don't overwrite the "Total Rows" count in Redis [cite: 642-644].
 * [cite_start]**Master Cleanup**: By deleting existing data for the batchId at the start of the thread, we ensure that no matter how many times the user retries, the final count in JOURNAL_REQUEST will always match the file [cite: 785-786].
 * [cite_start]**Precision Recovery**: The totals are now recovered using the RECOVERY_FACTOR, ensuring your financial dashboard is accurate.
